<li class="gallerybox" style="width: 145px;" id="mwCDY"><div class="thumb" style="width: 140px; height: 140px;" id="mwCDc"><span typeof="mw:File" id="mwCDg"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Deer_park_globe.svg" class="mw-file-description" title="Blue globe artwork, distributed with the source code, and is explicitly not protected as a trademark" id="mwCDk"><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Deer_park_globe.svg" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9f/Deer_park_globe.svg/120px-Deer_park_globe.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9f/Deer_park_globe.svg/250px-Deer_park_globe.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" alt="Blue globe artwork, distributed with the source code, and is explicitly not protected as a trademark" data-file-width="500" data-file-height="500" data-file-type="drawing" height="110" width="110" class="mw-file-element" id="mwCDo"/></a></span></div><div class="gallerytext" id="mwCDs">Blue globe artwork, distributed with the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Source_code" title="Source code" id="mwCDw">source code</a>, and is explicitly not protected as a trademark<sup about="#mwt1243" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-303" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-303"}}'><a href="#cite_note-303" id="mwCD0"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwCD4"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwCD8">[</span>303<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwCEA">]</span></span></a></sup></div></li>
<li class="gallerybox" style="width: 145px;" id="mwCEE"><div class="thumb" style="width: 140px; height: 140px;" id="mwCEI"><span typeof="mw:File" id="mwCEM"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Firefox_brand_logo,_2019.svg" class="mw-file-description" title="The logo for the Firefox brand of products and services, as of July 2019." id="mwCEQ"><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Firefox_brand_logo,_2019.svg" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7a/Firefox_brand_logo%2C_2019.svg/120px-Firefox_brand_logo%2C_2019.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7a/Firefox_brand_logo%2C_2019.svg/250px-Firefox_brand_logo%2C_2019.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" alt="The logo for the Firefox brand of products and services, as of July 2019." data-file-width="512" data-file-height="512" data-file-type="drawing" height="110" width="110" class="mw-file-element" id="mwCEU"/></a></span></div><div class="gallerytext" id="mwCEY">The logo for the Firefox brand of products and services, as of July 2019.</div></li>
</ul>

