<th scope="row" data-sort-value="154"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Firefox_version_history#Firefox_153_through_174" title="Firefox version history">Firefox 154</a></th>
<td>0.78%</td><td>0.02%</td></tr>
<tr>
<th scope="row" data-sort-value="155"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Firefox_version_history#Firefox_153_through_174" title="Firefox version history">Firefox 155</a></th>
<td>1.17%</td><td>0.03%</td></tr>
<tr>
<th scope="row" data-sort-value="156"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Firefox_version_history#Firefox_153_through_174" title="Firefox version history">Firefox 156</a></th>
<td>4.30%</td><td>0.11%</td></tr>
<tr>
<th scope="row" data-sort-value="157"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Firefox_version_history#Firefox_153_through_174" title="Firefox version history">Firefox 157</a></th>
<td>27.73%</td><td>0.71%</td></tr>
<tr>
<th scope="row" data-sort-value="158"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Firefox_version_history#Firefox_153_through_174" title="Firefox version history">Firefox 158</a></th>
<td>27.34%</td><td>0.70%</td></tr>
