<th scope="row" data-sort-value="159"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Firefox_version_history#Firefox_153_through_174" title="Firefox version history">Firefox 159</a></th>
<td>4.69%</td><td>0.12%</td></tr>
